.TH NETOFDOTS 1
.SH NAME
netofdots \- dot net pattern
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/netofdots
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I NetOfDots
is a dot net pattern.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Draws a radiating net of dotted lines: each line is plotted as
single red pixels every third step along its length, as the
TempleOS original does with
.B GrLine
step 3.
As in the original's
.BR PressAKey ,
pressing any key exits.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/netofdots.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
